5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see the conservation lab staffing and backlog! And the composition of the volunteer roster too!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall review the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
