23,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
24,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The suspended bay has a weight limit, and the evening hires mean we have caterers and chairs moving through the space.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Visitors are drawn to mechanisms and changing displays. They also specifically mention that having people working or talking in the gallery encourages return visits.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Rin,,The conservation lab is almost empty! There is a huge backlog of pieces waiting to be cleaned. But we have lots of town history volunteers.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Shipping cut-offs have caused openings to slip before, and powered displays are breaking down constantly, sometimes during opening hours.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Transport and insurance are eating up a third of our installation budget. Also, bespoke mount-making costs are rising sharply.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, if transport is that expensive, maybe we should avoid loans from far away?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, if the lab is backed up, we cannot afford a project that requires heavy conservation work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, you're right! We need something the volunteers can handle, not the lab.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, the weight limit is a big deal if we're bringing in heavy crates.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the maintenance issues you found suggest that ""high-tech"" might be a financial sinkhole.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the evening hires. If we have things that can't be moved or closed, they might get damaged.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,It seems the most successful shows are interactive or have a human presence.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Rin,,We should definitely use those town history volunteers! They know the area well.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I just don't want us to be apologizing at the door because the art is still on a boat.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely. We need a project that is budget-friendly, low-maintenance, and doesn't require expensive custom mounts.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
